& [AuthorityGrant] is exact
  + future separately claimed CPPE-I01 through CPPE-I09 may implement machine forms, normalized Process IR, deterministic compiler, static verifier, fake Observer admission harness, in-memory catalogue, deterministic interpreter, two-process token ring, replay, and fake controller transcript
