  + allowed procedure effect class is effectless only
  + no textual Simula compatibility, persistence, service, live model provider, hidden-state access, filesystem, network, database, clock, process, notification, Git, unsafe code, WASM, native backend, FPGA, device, or external effect
  + current specification campaign performs no implementation

& [Invalidation] is fail-closed
  + any locked artifact drift or upstream language invalidation
